# Side-effect hooks retain generated SMW collision. SMWDisX 3390ee1 bank_00
# order is CODE_00CCE0/CD24/CD36/CD82: UpdatePlayerSpritePosition ($DC2D)
# commits velocity to position, then HandlePlayerLevelCollision ($E92B), then
# PlayerState00_00CD36 ($CD36) joins the ordinary flow. Restrict M1X1.
@hook UpdatePlayerSpritePosition -> SmwFalconBeforePhysics M1X1
@hook PlayerState00_00CD36 -> SmwFalconAfterPhysics M1X1
